title: "MANIFOLD: Existing Manufacturing Dataset Catalog and Research Roadmap"
message: "This citation describes the pre-award planning catalog, not the source datasets. Cite Harik et al. (2024, 2025) for the original Future Factories data; complete records are in references.bib."
authors:
